    "title": "Man gets 25-year prison sentence for fatal Phoenix stabbing in 2024 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By KEVIN STONE ,\n8 hours ago PHOENIX – A man was sentenced to 25 years in prison for a fatal stabbing in central Phoenix over a year ago, authorities announced Wednesday. A Maricopa County Superior Court jury found Damian Mitchell guilty of second-degree murder on Dec. 16, 2025. He had 390 days of time served when he was sentenced on Jan. 30, according to court documents. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 4",
